---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Physiotherapy Clinic in Sector 45 Faridabad | Neriva Health" 
    description="Looking for the best physiotherapy clinic in Faridabad? Nerivahealth offers expert care in Sector 45 and home visits for back pain, post-surgery, and sports injuries."
>
    <section class="section-padding" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-blue);">Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation in Faridabad</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--text-light); max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                Located in Sector 45, Faridabad, Nerivahealth is a dedicated physiotherapy and rehabilitation centre led by Dr. Abhishek Kumar. We provide evidence-based treatments for orthopedic, neurological, and sports-related conditions.
            </p>

            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
                <div style="background: var(--bg-light); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 0.5rem;">
                    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Our Sector 45 Clinic</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        Our fully equipped clinic provides a comfortable and professional environment for comprehensive assessments and hands-on therapy. We utilize modern rehabilitation equipment and advanced manual therapy techniques.
                    </p>
                    <p><strong>Address:</strong> House No. 114, 1st Floor, Sector-45, Faridabad</p>
                </div>
                <div style="background: var(--bg-light); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 0.5rem;">
                    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Home Physiotherapy</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        We understand that travel is difficult for patients with severe pain, elderly individuals, or those recovering from surgery. Dr. Abhishek provides professional physiotherapy sessions in the comfort of your home across Faridabad.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/home-physiotherapy-faridabad" style="color: var(--primary-blue); font-weight: 600;">Learn more about home visits →</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Ready to start your recovery?</h2>
            <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book an Appointment</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
